meta {
	name: 01_RequestAndPartialApprove
	seq: 1
}

docs {
	Scenario: An organisation asks a person for two rights on a resource and gets one of them

		Given the approver has no pending request from the requester for the resource
		And the approver can delegate at least two rights on the resource
		When the requester asks for two rights on the resource through v2
		Then the approver sees the requested rights on the request
		When the approver approves only one of the rights
		Then the request is PartialApprove with the approved right
		And the requester sees the request as PartialApprove among its sent requests
		And v1 reports the request as Approved with statusV2 PartialApprove
		And only the approved right is delegated to the requester
		And approving the request again fails
		Finally the approver removes the delegation to clean up
}
